	<item>
		<title>WWE Raw Results &#8211; 11/9/26 (Fallout from Crown Jewel, Cody Rhodes to appear)</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-raw-results/397068-live-wwe-raw-results-november-9-2026-greenville/</link>
